From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] userconsentverifier: the statics factory answers IAgileObject (3733)

userconsentverifier: the statics factory answers IAgileObject

Windows runtime activation factories are agile; this one answered
E_NOINTERFACE. The Wine test now checks it.
---
diff --git a/dlls/windows.security.credentials.ui.userconsentverifier/main.c b/dlls/windows.security.credentials.ui.userconsentverifier/main.c
index 37b9228..69b4f91 100644
--- a/dlls/windows.security.credentials.ui.userconsentverifier/main.c
+++ b/dlls/windows.security.credentials.ui.userconsentverifier/main.c
@@ -44,6 +44,9 @@ static HRESULT WINAPI factory_QueryInterface( IActivationFactory *iface, REFIID
 
     if (IsEqualGUID( iid, &IID_IUnknown ) ||
         IsEqualGUID( iid, &IID_IInspectable ) ||
+#ifndef SG_MUTANT_UCV_FACTORY_AGILE
+        IsEqualGUID( iid, &IID_IAgileObject ) ||
+#endif
         IsEqualGUID( iid, &IID_IActivationFactory ))
     {
         *out = &impl->IActivationFactory_iface;
diff --git a/dlls/windows.security.credentials.ui.userconsentverifier/tests/verifier.c b/dlls/windows.security.credentials.ui.userconsentverifier/tests/verifier.c
index 0a02579..b08633c 100644
--- a/dlls/windows.security.credentials.ui.userconsentverifier/tests/verifier.c
+++ b/dlls/windows.security.credentials.ui.userconsentverifier/tests/verifier.c
@@ -227,6 +227,7 @@ static void test_UserConsentVerifierStatics(void)
 
     check_interface( factory, &IID_IUnknown );
     check_interface( factory, &IID_IInspectable );
+    check_interface( factory, &IID_IAgileObject );
 
     hr = IActivationFactory_QueryInterface( factory, &IID_IUserConsentVerifierStatics, (void **)&user_consent_verifier_statics );
     ok( hr == S_OK, "got hr %#lx.\n", hr );
